{
  "$schema": "https://json.schemastore.org/claude-code-settings.json",
  "_comment": "ATENCAO: NUNCA coloque segredos (tokens, API keys, senhas) no campo 'env' deste arquivo — settings.json e versionado no git. Use .env (gitignored) + carregamento via dotenv no codigo, ou variaveis exportadas no shell antes de rodar claude.",
  "_comment_allow": "SUBSTITUA OBRIGATORIAMENTE os placeholders <comando-de-teste> e <comando-de-dev> pelos comandos reais do projeto (ex: 'npm test', 'pytest', 'npm run dev', 'cargo run') ANTES do primeiro uso — caso contrario o agente vai pedir confirmacao a cada execucao. Allowlist generosa para read-only/comuns: deny vence allow, entao publicacao/destruicao real fica bloqueada mesmo com prefix allow.",
  "_comment_placeholders_pendentes": "Se este arquivo ainda contem strings com < > (ex: <comando-de-teste>, <NomeDoProjeto>, <modelo>), o template NAO foi instanciado. Substitua antes de iniciar trabalho real.",
  "_comment_modes": "defaultMode aproveita a pro-atividade declarada em CLAUDE.md global. Modos suportados: default | acceptEdits | plan | bypassPermissions. Ver matriz-harness.md secao 3.",
  "_comment_acceptEdits_tradeoff": "acceptEdits acelera execucao (escrita auto-aprovada) mas, isolado, deixa o agente atropelar a disciplina de Descoberta (C1). Por isso o phase-gate.sh em PreToolUse Write|Edit bloqueia escrita em src/ enquanto docs/descoberta/sintese-final.md nao estiver status:stable e ADR-0001 (stack) nao estiver aceita. Se trocar para 'default' (cada edicao confirmada), o phase-gate continua relevante mas perde urgencia. Para projetos micro/experimento, criar .claude/.phase-gate-disabled vazio para desligar o gate.",
  "_comment_hook_order": "Ordem dos hooks em PreToolUse/Bash importa: override-ledger.sh roda PRIMEIRO e apenas LOGA o uso de override (le .claude/.override-reason, NAO apaga); block-destructive.sh e no-verify-bypass.sh rodam em seguida e leem o MESMO arquivo para liberar operacoes legitimas com override, e ainda podem bloquear padroes criticos. O consumo de uso unico (apagar .override-reason) fica no override-consume.sh em PostToolUse/Bash, que roda DEPOIS de todo o PreToolUse passar e o comando executar. Se o ledger apagasse o arquivo ainda no PreToolUse, os hooks seguintes bloqueariam force-with-lease/--no-verify legitimos. Ver matriz-harness.md secao 1.",
  "model": "<modelo>",
  "defaultMode": "acceptEdits",
  "permissions": {
    "allow": [
      "Read",
      "Edit",
      "Write",
      "Glob",
      "Grep",
      "Bash(<comando-de-teste>:*)",
      "Bash(<comando-de-dev>:*)",
      "Bash(ls:*)",
      "Bash(pwd:*)",
      "Bash(which:*)",
      "Bash(echo:*)",
      "Bash(cat:*)",
      "Bash(head:*)",
      "Bash(tail:*)",
      "Bash(find:*)",
      "Bash(mkdir:*)",
      "Bash(cp:*)",
      "Bash(mv:*)",
      "Bash(grep:*)",
      "Bash(sed:*)",
      "Bash(awk:*)",
      "Bash(wc:*)",
      "Bash(sort:*)",
      "Bash(uniq:*)",
      "Bash(tr:*)",
      "Bash(cut:*)",
      "Bash(date:*)",
      "Bash(test:*)",
      "Bash(true:*)",
      "Bash(false:*)",
      "Bash(env:*)",
      "Bash(printenv:*)",
      "Bash(basename:*)",
      "Bash(dirname:*)",
      "Bash(stat:*)",
      "Bash(file:*)",
      "Bash(diff:*)",
      "Bash(chmod:*)",
      "Bash(git status:*)",
      "Bash(git diff:*)",
      "Bash(git log:*)",
      "Bash(git show:*)",
      "Bash(git branch:*)",
      "Bash(git checkout:*)",
      "Bash(git switch:*)",
      "Bash(git stash:*)",
      "Bash(git fetch:*)",
      "Bash(git pull:*)",
      "Bash(git rev-parse:*)",
      "Bash(git ls-files:*)",
      "Bash(git config:*)",
      "Bash(git add:*)",
      "Bash(git commit:*)",
      "Bash(git push origin:*)",
      "Bash(git push --set-upstream:*)",
      "Bash(git revert:*)",
      "Bash(git tag:*)",
      "Bash(git remote:*)",
      "Bash(gh:*)",
      "Bash(npm:*)",
      "Bash(pnpm:*)",
      "Bash(yarn:*)",
      "Bash(node:*)",
      "Bash(python:*)",
      "Bash(python3:*)",
      "Bash(pip:*)",
      "Bash(uv:*)",
      "Bash(poetry:*)",
      "Bash(cargo:*)",
      "Bash(go:*)",
      "Bash(make:*)",
      "Bash(just:*)",
      "Bash(sqlite3:*)",
      "Bash(jq:*)",
      "Bash(rg:*)",
      "Bash(curl:*)",
      "Bash(wget:*)"
    ],
    "deny": [
      "Bash(rm -rf:*)",
      "Bash(rm -fr:*)",
      "Bash(rm -Rf:*)",
      "Bash(git push --force:*)",
      "Bash(git push -f:*)",
      "Bash(git push * --force:*)",
      "Bash(git push * -f:*)",
      "Bash(git reset --hard origin:*)",
      "Bash(git clean -fd:*)",
      "Bash(git clean -fdx:*)",
      "Bash(git branch -D:*)",
      "Bash(npm publish:*)",
      "Bash(yarn publish:*)",
      "Bash(pnpm publish:*)",
      "Bash(cargo publish:*)",
      "Bash(cargo yank:*)",
      "Bash(gem push:*)",
      "Bash(pip publish:*)",
      "Bash(twine upload:*)",
      "Bash(sudo:*)",
      "Bash(drop database:*)",
      "Bash(drop table:*)",
      "Bash(drop schema:*)",
      "Bash(gh repo delete:*)",
      "Bash(gh repo edit --visibility:*)",
      "Bash(mkfs:*)",
      "Bash(mkfs.ext4:*)",
      "Bash(mkfs.xfs:*)",
      "Bash(dd if=:*)",
      "Bash(dd of=:*)"
    ],
    "ask": ["Bash(git reset --hard:*)", "Bash(git push --force-with-lease:*)"]
  },
  "hooks": {
    "SessionStart": [
      {
        "hooks": [
          { "type": "command", "command": "bash \"$CLAUDE_PROJECT_DIR/.claude/hooks/check-deps.sh\"" },
          { "type": "command", "command": "bash \"$CLAUDE_PROJECT_DIR/.claude/hooks/staleness-checker.sh\"" }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "UserPromptSubmit": [
      {
        "hooks": [{ "type": "command", "command": "bash \"$CLAUDE_PROJECT_DIR/.claude/hooks/inject-context.sh\"" }]
      }
    ],
    "PreToolUse": [
      {
        "matcher": "Bash",
        "hooks": [
          { "type": "command", "command": "bash \"$CLAUDE_PROJECT_DIR/.claude/hooks/override-ledger.sh\"" },
          { "type": "command", "command": "bash \"$CLAUDE_PROJECT_DIR/.claude/hooks/block-destructive.sh\"" },
          { "type": "command", "command": "bash \"$CLAUDE_PROJECT_DIR/.claude/hooks/no-verify-bypass.sh\"" },
          { "type": "command", "command": "bash \"$CLAUDE_PROJECT_DIR/.claude/hooks/auditor-commit-hygiene.sh\"" }
        ]
      },
      {
        "matcher": "Write",
        "hooks": [
          { "type": "command", "command": "bash \"$CLAUDE_PROJECT_DIR/.claude/hooks/secrets-scanner.sh\"" },
          { "type": "command", "command": "bash \"$CLAUDE_PROJECT_DIR/.claude/hooks/anti-mascaramento.sh\"" },
          { "type": "command", "command": "bash \"$CLAUDE_PROJECT_DIR/.claude/hooks/frontmatter-validator.sh\"" },
          { "type": "command", "command": "bash \"$CLAUDE_PROJECT_DIR/.claude/hooks/doc-line-counter.sh\"" },
          { "type": "command", "command": "bash \"$CLAUDE_PROJECT_DIR/.claude/hooks/phase-gate.sh\"" }
        ]
      },
      {
        "matcher": "Edit",
        "hooks": [
          { "type": "command", "command": "bash \"$CLAUDE_PROJECT_DIR/.claude/hooks/secrets-scanner.sh\"" },
          { "type": "command", "command": "bash \"$CLAUDE_PROJECT_DIR/.claude/hooks/anti-mascaramento.sh\"" },
          { "type": "command", "command": "bash \"$CLAUDE_PROJECT_DIR/.claude/hooks/frontmatter-validator.sh\"" },
          { "type": "command", "command": "bash \"$CLAUDE_PROJECT_DIR/.claude/hooks/doc-line-counter.sh\"" },
          { "type": "command", "command": "bash \"$CLAUDE_PROJECT_DIR/.claude/hooks/phase-gate.sh\"" }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "PostToolUse": [
      {
        "matcher": "Bash",
        "hooks": [{ "type": "command", "command": "bash \"$CLAUDE_PROJECT_DIR/.claude/hooks/override-consume.sh\"" }]
      }
    ]
  },
  "env": {
    "PROJECT_NAME": "<NomeDoProjeto>",
    "PROJECT_OWNER_NAME": "<dono-do-projeto>"
  },
  "additionalDirectories": ["docs", ".agent", ".claude"]
}
